{"ref":"BDB, אָטָד","hw":"אָטָד","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אָטָד</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Judges 9:15\" href=\"/Judges.9.15\">Ju 9:15</a></sup> <strong>bramble, buck-thorn</strong> (cf. Che <a data-ref=\"Psalms 58:10\" href=\"/Psalms.58.10\">ψ 58:10</a>) <strong>(</strong><em>rhamnus</em>, Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">أَطَد</span>, Assyrian <em>eṭidu</em> v. Dl<sup>W, No. 153</sup>, Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">אַטְדָּא</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ܐܛܕܐ</span> cf. Löw<sup> No. 15</sup><strong>)</strong> contr. <span dir=\"rtl\">עֵצִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 9:14\" href=\"/Judges.9.14\">Ju 9:14</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 9:15\" href=\"/Judges.9.15\">15</a><sup>(×2)</sup> (personif., in fable); <a data-ref=\"Psalms 58:10\" href=\"/Psalms.58.10\">ψ 58:10</a> as fuel (in fig., cf. Che); <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּגֹרֶן הָא׳</span>, n.loc., <a data-ref=\"Genesis 50:10\" href=\"/Genesis.50.10\">Gn 50:10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 50:11\" href=\"/Genesis.50.11\">11</a> (v. <a data-ref=\"BDB, גֹּ֫רֶן\" href=\"/BDB,_גֹּ֫רֶן\", dir=\"rtl\">גֹּרֶן</a> & <a data-ref=\"BDB, אֵבֶל מִצְרַיִם\" href=\"/BDB,_אֵבֶל מִצְרַיִם\", dir=\"rtl\">אבל מצרים</a>).","next":"BDB, אטט","prev":"BDB, אטד"}